e, der Erfolg sei ein Verdienst des ganzen Teams.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Sportnachricht: Die Kunstturnerin nach dem Wettkampf","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"b2-59-konjunktiv-i-formen","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Timo, schau, in der Zeitung steht: der Trainer sagt, das Rennen sei sehr spannend gewesen.","speaker":"Ida","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_059_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-59-konjunktiv-i-formen","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"\"Sei\" statt \"ist\" — das ist der Konjunktiv I, oder?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_059_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-59-konjunktiv-i-formen","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Genau, und weiter unten steht, der Fahrer habe keine Angst gehabt.","speaker":"Ida","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_059_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-59-konjunktiv-i-formen","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Klingt fast wie ein anderes Verb, dabei ist es einfach nur \"haben\" im Konjunktiv I.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_059_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-59-konjunktiv-i-formen","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-59-konjunktiv-i-formen","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Timo, schau, in der Zeitung steht: der Trainer sagt, das Rennen sei sehr spannend gewesen.","speaker":"Ida","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_059_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-59-konjunktiv-i-formen","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"\"Sei\" statt \"ist\" — das ist der Konjunktiv I, oder?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_059_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-59-konjunktiv-i-formen","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Genau, und weiter unten steht, der Fahrer habe keine Angst gehabt.","speaker":"Ida","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_059_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-59-konjunktiv-i-formen","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Klingt fast wie ein anderes Verb, dabei ist es einfach nur \"haben\" im Konjunktiv I.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_059_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Sei statt ist zeigt, dass der Trainer das gesagt hat.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-59-konjunktiv-i-formen","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-59-konjunktiv-i-formen","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Dein Freund liest in der Zeitung „das Rennen sei spannend gewesen\". Erklär die Form.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Er sei, er habe, er werde — das sind die drei wichtigsten.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-59-konjunktiv-i-formen","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-59-konjunktiv-i-formen","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Er fragt nach den drei häufigsten Formen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":3,"text":"Der Konsument sagte, er habe den Kaufvertrag nie unterschrieben.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-59-konjunktiv-i-formen","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-59-konjunktiv-i-formen","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":3,"text":"Lies für die Lerngruppe die Meldung über den Kaufvertrag vor.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":4,"text":"Bei wir fällt die Form mit dem Indikativ zusammen, deshalb nimmt man würde.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-59-konjunktiv-i-formen","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-59-konjunktiv-i-formen","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":4,"text":"Eine Lernpartnerin fragt, warum wir kommen gleich aussieht.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":5,"text":"Der Kunstturner erklärte, er sei fit. — Und der Trainer sagte, der Kader werde größer.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-59-konjunktiv-i-formen","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-59-konjunktiv-i-formen","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":5,"text":"Rollenspiel: Ihr lest Sportmeldungen vor.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false}],"controls":{"story-play-line":6,"story-play-all":1,"vword-voice-F":22,"vword-voice-M":22,"vword-listen":22,"listen-to-passage":1,"audio-play-btn":1,"hear-model":5},"surfaces":[{"n":1,"w":"Jugendbereiche","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":7,"w":"der","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":1,"w":"Kader","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Kartrennen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":5,"w":"das","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":1,"w":"Kaufverträge","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Konsumenten","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":3,"w":"der/die","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":1,"w":"— (Pl.)","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":4,"w":"die","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":1,"w":"Kritisierten","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Kundenkonten","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":3,"w":"— (Sg.)","from":"vocab-plural"